		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Brambleblade Ravine cuts into the hills east of {link:red-cloud-mesa}Red Cloud Mesa{/link}. It is choked with thorns, and in it the {link:bristleback-quilboar}Bristleback quilboar{/link} have built a rough village. From here their raiders creep onto the mesa to ambush the hunting parties of {link:camp-narache}Camp Narache{/link}. The {link:quilboar}quilboar{/link} train battleboars in the ravine and teach them to be vicious. Their chief, {link:chief-sharptusk-thornmantle}Sharptusk Thornmantle{/link}, keeps his hut at the ravine's heart, and the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} of Narache say that his war on them has cost many lives since they came to this land.]=],
		},
	},
