		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Venture Co. Mine is cut into the eastern cliffs of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}, north-east of Stonebull Lake. Here the goblins of the {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link} dig ore and minerals from {link:tauren}tauren{/link} land without leave. Their supervisor, {link:supervisor-fizsprocket}Fizsprocket{/link}, kept plans for driving the tauren out of Mulgore altogether, so that the company could plunder the plains at will. His notes speak also of shredders, great machines that can fell a forest in days, and of the company's plans to spread further across the land.]=],
