		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Ravaged Caravan lies on the northern shore of Stonebull Lake. It was a {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link} train travelling under guard, and the {link:tauren}tauren{/link}, who had lost two of their own to the goblins in an earlier fight, fell upon it and burned it. They left the supply crates behind, thinking the fire had spoiled them. It had not. The crates held ore taken from {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link} and a sheaf of papers that revealed the size of the company's mining in the tauren lands.]=],
