		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Palemane Rock is a cave in the western hills of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}, the lair of the {link:palemane-gnolls}Palemane gnolls{/link}. From here the gnolls go out to poach the herds, skin their kills and tan the hides, taking far more than the land can give. The {link:tauren}tauren{/link} tried to speak with them and were met with scorn. In these days the High Chieftain sent a {link:longwalkers}Longwalker{/link}, {link:perith-stormhoof}Perith Stormhoof{/link}, to try once more. The gnolls answered with violence, and Perith was held inside the rock, fearing that he would become their feast.]=],
