		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Windfury Ridge is the high northern rim of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}, where the plains climb toward the mountains. It is the stronghold of the {link:windfury-harpies}Windfury harpies{/link}. Their matriarchs and sorceresses roost among the crags, and their witches call on the wind. The {link:tauren}tauren{/link} count the harpies among the natural enemies of Mulgore, yet they also prize the azure and bronze feathers of the northern flocks for the headdresses worn before the High Chieftain. The {link:harpies}harpy{/link} Sister Hatelash is said to lead the flocks of the north-west.]=],
		},
	},
})

