			text = [=[Camp Gev'rek stands on Skywatcher Plateau in the north-west of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}. It is a gathering of the {link:earthen-ring}Earthen Ring{/link}: {link:tauren}tauren{/link} shamans, a troll, even one of {link:grimtotem-clan}the Grimtotem{/link}, led by {link:muln-earthfury}Muln Earthfury{/link} and the elder farseer Nuara Tremorhoof. Here the skycutter ships of the {link:windshapers}Windshapers{/link} come down from {link:zephras-isle}Zephras Isle{/link}, bringing {link:skyborne}Skyborne{/link} elves to a world they have never seen. {link:alaana-stormwalker}Alaana Stormwalker{/link} greets each new arrival. Beside the camp a goblin trader, a priestess of An'she and handlers of the Skyborne galestriders have set up their stalls.]=],
		},
	},
