			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Baine Bloodhoof is the son of {link:cairne-bloodhoof}Cairne Bloodhoof{/link} and the chief of {link:bloodhoof-village}Bloodhoof Village{/link}. He rules the heart of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link} while his father rules from {link:thunder-bluff}Thunder Bluff{/link}. He is patient with those who would share the land, and stern with those who will not. He has seen many of the conflicts that wound the world, and he hopes the young of his tribe will see fewer.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Baine is the next generation of the Bloodhoof. The young who pass through his village learn from him what it means to defend the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} homeland.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He continues the {link:rites-of-the-earthmother}Rites of the Earthmother{/link}, and sends the young to the spiritual leader {link:zarlman-two-moons}Zarlman Two-Moons{/link} for the Rite of Vision.
• He ordered the {link:palemane-gnolls}Palemane gnolls{/link} driven back when they refused every attempt at peace.
• He ordered the tools of the dwarven diggers destroyed.
• He sometimes calls on the {link:longwalkers}Longwalkers{/link}, his father's scouts, for aid.
• He led the defense against a Galak raiding party in these days.]=],
		},
	},
