			},
			text = [=[In the months after the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} settled {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}, {link:centaurs}centaur{/link} seized Baine. His father fell into a despair so deep that he would not lead. It was the {link:orcs}orc{/link} {link:rexxar}Rexxar{/link} and the tauren Bovan Windtotem who found Baine and brought him home. When Baine now sends the young to his father, he speaks with pride of the day {link:cairne-bloodhoof}Cairne{/link} rode with {link:thrall}Thrall{/link} to reclaim these plains.]=],
