			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Ruul Eagletalon calls himself a warrior and a teacher. He watches for the moment when a young {link:tauren}tauren{/link} is ready to go further than the plains of home. He holds that a tauren must prepare for trials before venturing much further than home. Those who wish to test their strength he sends against the {link:windfury-harpies}Windfury harpies{/link}, whom he counts among the natural enemies of {link:mulgore}Mulgore{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Ruul's test prepares the young for the trials that wait beyond the mountains. The harpies nest along the mountain edges, far from the road, and to find them a young warrior must leave the safety of the plains.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
